{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46970","headline":"中秋夕怆怀寄荆幕孙郎中 · 齐己","name":"中秋夕怆怀寄荆幕孙郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白莲香散沼痕乾，绿筱阴浓藓地寒。\n年老寄居思隐切，夜凉留客话时难。\n行僧尽去云山远，宾鴈同来泽国宽。\n时谢孔璋操檄外，每将空病问衰残。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46970.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46970","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}